<title>USA: Boeing plans shareholders meeting July 25.</title>
<headline>Boeing plans shareholders meeting July 25.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boeing and McDonnell Douglas plan to hold shareholders meetings on July 25 to approve their merger, a spokeswoman said Tuesday.</p>
<p>The merger won unconditional approval from U.S. regulators earlier in the day and European regulators expect to complete their review by month's end.</p>
<p>The two firms will complete their merger on Aug. 1 and begin operating as the Boeing Co. on Aug. 4, the spokeswoman said.</p>
